---
description: Dockerfile rules
globs: 
alwaysApply: false
---

- create containers following best practices
- don't run code inside containers are root
- create necessary files for deploying in kubernetes
- when using kubernetes mount the config as a configmap on /app/config
- create secrets for passwords and usernames
- create a single json file for all settings where possible
- create all Kubernetes artifacts for running the container
- use configmaps for configurations and secrets for passwords

